{"lines": [{"start": 6, "end": 133, "text": "2 prompts built this pricing calculator. No code. You never touch it.", "words": [{"w": "2", "s": 6, "e": 10}, {"w": "prompts", "s": 13, "e": 23}, {"w": "built", "s": 26, "e": 31}, {"w": "this", "s": 32, "e": 37}, {"w": "pricing", "s": 37, "e": 46}, {"w": "calculator.", "s": 49, "e": 64}, {"w": "No", "s": 77, "e": 80}, {"w": "code.", "s": 83, "e": 92}, {"w": "You", "s": 101, "e": 105}, {"w": "never", "s": 110, "e": 119}, {"w": "touch", "s": 120, "e": 125}, {"w": "it.", "s": 127, "e": 131}]}, {"start": 142, "end": 252, "text": "First try. And neither prompt asks AI to build anything.", "words": [{"w": "First", "s": 142, "e": 149}, {"w": "try.", "s": 152, "e": 161}, {"w": "And", "s": 172, "e": 176}, {"w": "neither", "s": 179, "e": 185}, {"w": "prompt", "s": 189, "e": 197}, {"w": "asks", "s": 202, "e": 211}, {"w": "AI", "s": 213, "e": 222}, {"w": "to", "s": 223, "e": 228}, {"w": "build", "s": 229, "e": 236}, {"w": "anything.", "s": 237, "e": 249}]}, {"start": 262, "end": 364, "text": "Prompt one wants a build plan: one task per number.", "words": [{"w": "Prompt", "s": 262, "e": 271}, {"w": "one", "s": 275, "e": 281}, {"w": "wants", "s": 285, "e": 290}, {"w": "a", "s": 292, "e": 295}, {"w": "build", "s": 296, "e": 301}, {"w": "plan:", "s": 304, "e": 313}, {"w": "one", "s": 323, "e": 328}, {"w": "task", "s": 331, "e": 341}, {"w": "per", "s": 344, "e": 347}, {"w": "number.", "s": 350, "e": 360}]}, {"start": 372, "end": 461, "text": "If a number hides two jobs, it has to split it.", "words": [{"w": "If", "s": 372, "e": 374}, {"w": "a", "s": 375, "e": 377}, {"w": "number", "s": 378, "e": 385}, {"w": "hides", "s": 388, "e": 398}, {"w": "two", "s": 401, "e": 406}, {"w": "jobs,", "s": 410, "e": 423}, {"w": "it", "s": 430, "e": 433}, {"w": "has", "s": 435, "e": 442}, {"w": "to", "s": 442, "e": 446}, {"w": "split", "s": 448, "e": 454}, {"w": "it.", "s": 455, "e": 458}]}, {"start": 471, "end": 651, "text": "So \"add ingredients\" became four: price paid, pack size, amount used, then the cost.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 471, "e": 477}, {"w": "\"add", "s": 484, "e": 490}, {"w": "ingredients\"", "s": 491, "e": 508}, {"w": "became", "s": 511, "e": 519}, {"w": "four:", "s": 525, "e": 533}, {"w": "price", "s": 542, "e": 548}, {"w": "paid,", "s": 551, "e": 559}, {"w": "pack", "s": 569, "e": 575}, {"w": "size,", "s": 578, "e": 589}, {"w": "amount", "s": 596, "e": 605}, {"w": "used,", "s": 608, "e": 617}, {"w": "then", "s": 628, "e": 632}, {"w": "the", "s": 633, "e": 635}, {"w": "cost.", "s": 636, "e": 647}]}, {"start": 661, "end": 743, "text": "Forty-four steps, each doing one job.", "words": [{"w": "Forty-four", "s": 661, "e": 674}, {"w": "steps,", "s": 680, "e": 690}, {"w": "each", "s": 702, "e": 710}, {"w": "doing", "s": 710, "e": 721}, {"w": "one", "s": 722, "e": 727}, {"w": "job.", "s": 731, "e": 740}]}, {"start": 754, "end": 979, "text": "It even caught a pricing mistake most people make: a 30% margin means dividing by 0.7, not adding 30%.", "words": [{"w": "It", "s": 754, "e": 756}, {"w": "even", "s": 758, "e": 764}, {"w": "caught", "s": 765, "e": 769}, {"w": "a", "s": 770, "e": 773}, {"w": "pricing", "s": 774, "e": 785}, {"w": "mistake", "s": 785, "e": 796}, {"w": "most", "s": 800, "e": 807}, {"w": "people", "s": 808, "e": 815}, {"w": "make:", "s": 816, "e": 823}, {"w": "a", "s": 830, "e": 833}, {"w": "30%", "s": 835, "e": 851}, {"w": "margin", "s": 854, "e": 865}, {"w": "means", "s": 866, "e": 872}, {"w": "dividing", "s": 874, "e": 887}, {"w": "by", "s": 887, "e": 890}, {"w": "0.7,", "s": 896, "e": 925}, {"w": "not", "s": 935, "e": 943}, {"w": "adding", "s": 946, "e": 956}, {"w": "30%.", "s": 956, "e": 976}]}, {"start": 992, "end": 1079, "text": "But that plan is written for you, not for the AI.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 992, "e": 995}, {"w": "that", "s": 997, "e": 1002}, {"w": "plan", "s": 1003, "e": 1009}, {"w": "is", "s": 1010, "e": 1014}, {"w": "written", "s": 1015, "e": 1022}, {"w": "for", "s": 1022, "e": 1025}, {"w": "you,", "s": 1031, "e": 1038}, {"w": "not", "s": 1049, "e": 1054}, {"w": "for", "s": 1055, "e": 1058}, {"w": "the", "s": 1059, "e": 1061}, {"w": "AI.", "s": 1064, "e": 1075}]}, {"start": 1091, "end": 1187, "text": "Prompt two turns it into orders for a coding assistant.", "words": [{"w": "Prompt", "s": 1091, "e": 1099}, {"w": "two", "s": 1105, "e": 1114}, {"w": "turns", "s": 1118, "e": 1124}, {"w": "it", "s": 1126, "e": 1128}, {"w": "into", "s": 1129, "e": 1138}, {"w": "orders", "s": 1140, "e": 1152}, {"w": "for", "s": 1154, "e": 1156}, {"w": "a", "s": 1157, "e": 1159}, {"w": "coding", "s": 1161, "e": 1169}, {"w": "assistant.", "s": 1170, "e": 1184}]}, {"start": 1195, "end": 1294, "text": "Nothing merged. Nothing skipped. Nothing reordered.", "words": [{"w": "Nothing", "s": 1195, "e": 1203}, {"w": "merged.", "s": 1207, "e": 1219}, {"w": "Nothing", "s": 1230, "e": 1237}, {"w": "skipped.", "s": 1241, "e": 1252}, {"w": "Nothing", "s": 1265, "e": 1273}, {"w": "reordered.", "s": 1276, "e": 1289}]}, {"start": 1307, "end": 1476, "text": "I pasted that into Claude. It built this, tested its own math, and fixed a rounding bug by itself.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 1307, "e": 1309}, {"w": "pasted", "s": 1310, "e": 1319}, {"w": "that", "s": 1321, "e": 1324}, {"w": "into", "s": 1325, "e": 1331}, {"w": "Claude.", "s": 1332, "e": 1343}, {"w": "It", "s": 1352, "e": 1356}, {"w": "built", "s": 1357, "e": 1363}, {"w": "this,", "s": 1364, "e": 1372}, {"w": "tested", "s": 1381, "e": 1390}, {"w": "its", "s": 1391, "e": 1396}, {"w": "own", "s": 1398, "e": 1403}, {"w": "math,", "s": 1405, "e": 1414}, {"w": "and", "s": 1417, "e": 1420}, {"w": "fixed", "s": 1424, "e": 1429}, {"w": "a", "s": 1431, "e": 1434}, {"w": "rounding", "s": 1435, "e": 1444}, {"w": "bug", "s": 1447, "e": 1453}, {"w": "by", "s": 1454, "e": 1457}, {"w": "itself.", "s": 1458, "e": 1472}]}, {"start": 1487, "end": 1643, "text": "The example cake: 58.52 euros to make, 83.59 to sell.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 1487, "e": 1489}, {"w": "example", "s": 1490, "e": 1501}, {"w": "cake:", "s": 1505, "e": 1511}, {"w": "58.52", "s": 1520, "e": 1549}, {"w": "euros", "s": 1552, "e": 1562}, {"w": "to", "s": 1563, "e": 1566}, {"w": "make,", "s": 1568, "e": 1577}, {"w": "83.59", "s": 1587, "e": 1624}, {"w": "to", "s": 1625, "e": 1629}, {"w": "sell.", "s": 1631, "e": 1639}]}, {"start": 1657, "end": 1759, "text": "DM me PROMPT and I'll send you both prompts, word for word.", "words": [{"w": "DM", "s": 1657, "e": 1663}, {"w": "me", "s": 1664, "e": 1668}, {"w": "PROMPT", "s": 1669, "e": 1681}, {"w": "and", "s": 1685, "e": 1690}, {"w": "I'll", "s": 1690, "e": 1694}, {"w": "send", "s": 1695, "e": 1699}, {"w": "you", "s": 1700, "e": 1705}, {"w": "both", "s": 1706, "e": 1712}, {"w": "prompts,", "s": 1715, "e": 1725}, {"w": "word", "s": 1734, "e": 1741}, {"w": "for", "s": 1742, "e": 1746}, {"w": "word.", "s": 1747, "e": 1755}]}], "end": 1759, "total": 1789}